{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22023","main_id":22023,"main_title":"家乡之味","main_description":"来自璃月的学者汤雯似乎饱受思乡之情的困扰…","chapter_title":"家乡之味","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2202301,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202301,"sequence":9,"variant":0,"line_id":220230123,"next_line_ids":[220230124],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3022,"speaker_text_hash":727626069,"speaker":"汤雯","speaker_raw":"汤雯","text_hash":1209410354,"text":"一想起这样的肉，我就情不自禁地颤抖起来…","raw_text":"一想起这样的肉，我就情不自禁地颤抖起来…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202301.json"}
