{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22023","main_id":22023,"main_title":"家乡之味","main_description":"来自璃月的学者汤雯似乎饱受思乡之情的困扰…","chapter_title":"家乡之味","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2202301,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202301,"sequence":12,"variant":0,"line_id":220230106,"next_line_ids":[220230107],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3022,"speaker_text_hash":727626069,"speaker":"汤雯","speaker_raw":"汤雯","text_hash":3699043186,"text":"先自我介绍一下，我叫汤雯，是来自璃月的历史学者，之前正在实地调研稻妻的特色风俗与民话。","raw_text":"先自我介绍一下，我叫汤雯，是来自璃月的历史学者，之前正在实地调研稻妻的特色风俗与民话。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202301.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22023","main_id":22023,"main_title":"家乡之味","main_description":"来自璃月的学者汤雯似乎饱受思乡之情的困扰…","chapter_title":"家乡之味","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2202301,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202301,"sequence":13,"variant":0,"line_id":220230107,"next_line_ids":[220230108],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3022,"speaker_text_hash":727626069,"speaker":"汤雯","speaker_raw":"汤雯","text_hash":1220033314,"text":"本来资料已经搜集的差不多了，正准备返回璃月。但是因为稻妻的锁国令结被迫滞留在这里，已经有一段时间了…","raw_text":"本来资料已经搜集的差不多了，正准备返回璃月。但是因为稻妻的锁国令结被迫滞留在这里，已经有一段时间了…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202301.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22023","main_id":22023,"main_title":"家乡之味","main_description":"来自璃月的学者汤雯似乎饱受思乡之情的困扰…","chapter_title":"家乡之味","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2202301,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202301,"sequence":14,"variant":0,"line_id":220230108,"next_line_ids":[220230109],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3022,"speaker_text_hash":727626069,"speaker":"汤雯","speaker_raw":"汤雯","text_hash":735729562,"text":"其实，我觉得这对我来说也算是好事。因为我感觉，此刻的稻妻正处于一个历史性的时刻！","raw_text":"其实，我觉得这对我来说也算是好事。因为我感觉，此刻的稻妻正处于一个历史性的时刻！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202301.json"}
