{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22023","main_id":22023,"main_title":"家乡之味","main_description":"来自璃月的学者汤雯似乎饱受思乡之情的困扰…","chapter_title":"家乡之味","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":3,"subquest_id":2202304,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202304,"sequence":21,"variant":0,"line_id":220230415,"next_line_ids":[220230416],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3022,"speaker_text_hash":727626069,"speaker":"汤雯","speaker_raw":"汤雯","text_hash":3377608306,"text":"但是吃久了稻妻菜，我还是想要再吃点璃月菜。不过，我一直都找不到能做出正宗璃月菜的餐馆。","raw_text":"但是吃久了稻妻菜，我还是想要再吃点璃月菜。不过，我一直都找不到能做出正宗璃月菜的餐馆。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202304.json"}
